# Archify: the skill is installed per clone (command in docs/ARCHITECTURE.md),
# not committed; its per-request work folders, the receipts it writes next to a
# diagram (absolute local paths) and the rendered HTML (regenerated from
# docs/diagrams/*.json) stay local too.
.claude/skills/archify/
skills-lock.json
.archify/
docs/diagrams/*.html
docs/diagrams/*.delivery.json
docs/diagrams/*.finalize*.json
docs/diagrams/*.browser-check.json
